an data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲速度2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲速度2</font></span></span>]，持续2回合，驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]；并在范围内其他地形格放置<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"苔原蜜果\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">苔原蜜果</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/95fesyla6xktqfwq5xmuiza580en874.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"74\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/95fesyla6xktqfwq5xmuiza580en874.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_2.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/95fesyla6xktqfwq5xmuiza580en874.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"187\" data-file-height=\"172\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B9%8C%E8%8E%89%E5%A8%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/乌莉娅\"><img alt=\"头像 乌莉娅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d3/4gxudq77xnlntmitcbxzlqhka07e7uf.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></